Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Acaba sesi güzel kaydediyor mu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Denizin sesi çok rahatlatıcı!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha? O da ne öyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yumuşacık!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cidden öyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar hoş bir ses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hadi, bunu da kaydedelim!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ton, ton, ton!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoppa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mıncık mıncık mıncık...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kıpırdadı mı?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirotan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Güzel sesler uykumu getiriyor...
